{"id": "61b16bff-3edb-4a5b-bedd-669465a9cffb", "slug": "transform-imagination-1", "title": "Transform Imagination", "description": "Transform Imagination Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Transform Imagination\"\ndescription: \"Transform Imagination Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F4F3EF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#F4F3EF\"\n  background: \"#F4F3EF\"\n  surface: \"#1E1E1E\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"GFS Didot\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"24px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Transform Imagination\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 86; favorites: 7; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, billing.\n## Overview\nTransform Imagination Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nA Aura Studio Platform Showcase Resources Pricing Log in Get started The new standard of creation Generate breathtaking visuals seamlessly Unlock a world of infinite creativity. Build, iterate, and launch stunning conce…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Generate breathtaking visuals seamlessly.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F4F3EF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #F4F3EF, background #F4F3EF, surface #1E1E1E, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and GFS Didot for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Transform Imagination</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f4f3ef;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* Smooth visual styling */\n        .glass-surface {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n        }\n\n        .premium-shadow {\n            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .button-shadow {\n            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n        }\n\n        /* Entrance Animations */\n        @keyframes fadeInUp {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px) scale(0.95); filter: blur(8px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); filter: blur(0); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes slideDownBlur {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); filter: blur(8px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); filter: blur(0); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes wordReveal {\n            0% { opacity: 0; filter: blur(10px); transform: translateY(16px) rotateX(-20deg); }\n            100% { opacity: 1; filter: blur(0); transform: translateY(0) rotateX(0); }\n        }\n\n        .animate-on-scroll {\n            opacity: 0;\n            will-change: transform, opacity, filter;\n        }\n\n        .animate-on-scroll.is-visible {\n            animation: fadeInUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n        }\n\n        .animate-nav {\n            opacity: 0;\n            animation: slideDownBlur 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n        }\n\n        .word-span {\n            display: inline-block;\n            opacity: 0;\n            will-change: transform, opacity, filter;\n        }\n\n        .word-span.is-visible {\n            animation: wordReveal 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n        }\n\n        /* Continuous Rotating & Floating Ring */\n        @keyframes rotate-ring {\n            from { transform: rotate(0deg); }\n            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes float {\n            0% { transform: translate(var(--tx), var(--ty)) rotate(var(--rot)); }\n            50% { transform: translate(var(--tx), calc(var(--ty) - 12px)) rotate(calc(var(--rot) + 2deg)); }\n            100% { transform: translate(var(--tx), var(--ty)) rotate(var(--rot)); }\n        }\n\n        .image-ring-scaler {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n\n        .ring-rotator {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            animation: rotate-ring 90s linear infinite;\n        }\n\n        .floating-image {\n            position: absolute;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 1.2s ease-out;\n            transform: translate(var(--tx), var(--ty)) rotate(var(--rot));\n        }\n\n        .floating-image.is-visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n            animation-delay: var(--float-delay, 0s);\n        }\n\n        /* Mobile scaling for the image ring */\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .image-ring-scaler {\n                transform: scale(0.55) translateY(-10%);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-gfs-didot\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=GFS+Didot&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-gfs-didot\">.font-gfs-didot { font-family: 'GFS Didot', serif !important; }</style><link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-newsreader\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400..800&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-newsreader\">.font-newsreader { font-family: 'Newsreader', serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-start relative w-full selection:bg-gray-800 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 animate-nav\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.1s;\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-medium text-sm shadow-sm font-newsreader\">A</div>\n            <span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight text-base font-newsreader\">Aura Studio</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-newsreader\">Platform</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-newsreader\">Showcase</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-newsreader\">Resources</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-newsreader\">Pricing</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block text-sm font-medium text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-newsreader\">Log in</a>\n            <!-- Premium Gradient Border Button -->\n            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-300 via-gray-400/40 to-gray-200/80 shadow-sm hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\">\n                <button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full glass-surface text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:bg-white transition-colors font-newsreader\">\n                    Get started\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Background Images Container (Rotating Abstract & Architecture to support 360 degree turns) -->\n    <div class=\"image-ring-scaler\">\n        <div class=\"ring-rotator\">\n            <!-- Top Center -->\n            <div class=\"floating-image w-36 h-36 rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden premium-shadow ring-1 ring-black/5\" style=\"--tx: 0rem; --ty: -24rem; --rot: 5deg; --float-delay: 0s; transition-delay: 0.1s;\">\n                <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779249417795-d9dd1a19-bafa-4928-9c7f-c21206b98ab0.png\" alt=\"Abstract\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-